CI/CD Goat: Caterpillar (CyberCTF lab)

This lab reproduces the "Caterpillar" challenge of CI/CD Goat, a deliberately vulnerable CI/CD
environment created by Cider Security (now part of Palo Alto Networks).

  Source:  https://github.com/cider-security-research/cicd-goat
  Release: 1.2.7 (commit 0ed10925f3983857cf219b2ac1c327b861fcccca)
  Licence: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE, copied verbatim from that release)

The upstream repository has no NOTICE file of its own. See UPSTREAM.md for what this lab takes
from CI/CD Goat and what it changes.
